@host = http://localhost:5000

GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### The fresh in-memory sample completes its empty managed-schema bootstrap before HTTP starts.
### Inspect the active vacancy generation and provider-wide schema protocol.

GET {{host}}/storage/index-schemas/vacancies
Accept: application/json

### The rebuild endpoint is idempotent while the registered generation is already active.

POST {{host}}/storage/index-schemas/vacancies/rebuild
Accept: application/json

### Inspect routing-compatible layout format 5: epoch 1, 64 virtual slots, schema protocol 1,
### and eight slots per initial owner.

GET {{host}}/storage/layout
Accept: application/json

### Store three vacancies

PUT {{host}}/vacancies/helsinki-6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Helsinki",
  "salary": 6
}

###

PUT {{host}}/vacancies/helsinki-7
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Helsinki",
  "salary": 7
}

###

PUT {{host}}/vacancies/tampere-9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Tampere",
  "salary": 9
}

### Recheck the unchanged routing map after writes.

GET {{host}}/storage/layout
Accept: application/json

###
### Explicit admin workflow. In production, quiesce all searchable traffic and restart every
### participant on the movement-capable package before this one-time enablement call.

POST {{host}}/storage/movement/enable
Accept: application/json

### No active move returns 204 No Content

GET {{host}}/storage/moves/active
Accept: application/json

### Ask for one deterministic next move toward nine physical owners.
### Copy nextMove.slot and nextMove.targetPartitionIndex into the planning request below.

GET {{host}}/storage/rebalance/plan?targetPartitionCount=9
Accept: application/json

### Persist exactly one move intent (replace the placeholders from the rebalance response).

POST {{host}}/storage/moves/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slot": {{slot}},
  "targetPartitionIndex": {{targetPartitionIndex}}
}

### Advance exactly one durable transition or bounded page payload; copy moveId from the plan response.
### A target or source whose protocol/epoch floor needs reconciliation can still report Planned;
### repeat this request until you observe SourceFrozen before trying the abort below.

POST {{host}}/storage/moves/{{moveId}}/advance
Accept: application/json

### Before ownership commits, abort runs/resumes bounded rollback pages.

POST {{host}}/storage/moves/{{moveId}}/abort
Accept: application/json

### Plan the same current rebalance nextMove again, then execute it through cleanup.

POST {{host}}/storage/moves/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slot": {{slot}},
  "targetPartitionIndex": {{targetPartitionIndex}}
}

### Replace moveId with the new plan response.

POST {{host}}/storage/moves/{{moveId}}/execute
Accept: application/json

### Complete the remaining deterministic single moves. Core storage has no automatic policy.

POST {{host}}/storage/rebalance/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetPartitionCount": 9
}

### Restore the sample's original balanced eight-owner shape.

POST {{host}}/storage/rebalance/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetPartitionCount": 8
}

### Read one vacancy

GET {{host}}/vacancies/helsinki-6
Accept: application/json

### IQueryable exact hash-index lookup

GET {{host}}/vacancies/search/by-city?city=Helsinki
Accept: application/json

### Bounded first page. Copy continuationToken from the response into the next request.

GET {{host}}/vacancies/search/by-city/page?city=Helsinki&pageSize=1
Accept: application/json

### Resume the same query (replace the placeholder with the opaque token from the first page)

GET {{host}}/vacancies/search/by-city/page?city=Helsinki&pageSize=1&continuation={{continuationToken}}
Accept: application/json

### IQueryable range lookup: values greater than 5 and less than 8

GET {{host}}/vacancies/search/by-salary?lower=5&upper=8&includeLower=false&includeUpper=false
Accept: application/json

### First value-ordered distinct-city facet page. Follow its token even if a page is short or empty.

GET {{host}}/vacancies/facets/cities?pageSize=1
Accept: application/json

### Resume the distinct facet (replace the placeholder with the opaque token above)

GET {{host}}/vacancies/facets/cities?pageSize=1&continuation={{facetContinuationToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Proven exact global top two city counts. Counts are filtered by the salary predicate.

GET {{host}}/vacancies/facets/cities/top?topN=2&accuracy=Exact&minimumSalary=7
Accept: application/json

### One-turn bounded approximation. Inspect both isExact and maximumOmittedCount.

GET {{host}}/vacancies/facets/cities/top?topN=1&accuracy=Approximate&minimumSalary=7
Accept: application/json

### Exact salary extrema for vacancies which currently match the Helsinki predicate

GET {{host}}/vacancies/facets/salaries/min-max?city=Helsinki
Accept: application/json

### Remove one vacancy and its index entries

DELETE {{host}}/vacancies/helsinki-6
